 f hours of constant smiles!&rdquo\; Time Out raves\, &ldquo\;Good Gosh! It
 &rsquo\;s big\, joyous musical fun!&rdquo\; And <em>Variety</em> declares\
 , &ldquo\;this irresistible musical turns the most skeptical curmudgeon in
 to a walking heart-eye emoji.&rdquo\;<br /><br />From <em>Saturday Night L
 ive</em>&rsquo\;s Lorne Michaels\, <em>Schmigadoon!</em> is directed by To
 ny Award winner Christopher Gattelli (<em>Newsies</em>\, <em>Death Becomes
  Her</em>)\, with a Tony Award-winning book and Tony- and Emmy&reg\; Award
 -winning score by Cinco Paul (<em>Despicable Me</em>\, <em>The Secret Life
